; --- The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild: the crater rim and the causeway. This roost was three crags in a ring around a nest
; --- at the exact centre of a 100 m plate - the same shape as the Wild roost and the Aerie, and the
; --- reason all three read alike from the ground. It is a BASIN now: a long exposed causeway in from
; --- the west, marked by three burnt pines standing in a line, then a crater whose rim is the only
; --- cover there is, with the nest off centre to the EAST at (10, 6). An 80 degree breath cone
; --- across open ground is the fight; the rim is where you get out of it.

